    "description": "RateByFresh is a mobile app that helps you become more attractive. \r\n\r\nHow it works is you upload your photos and our custom app will give you an objective rating on your attractiveness and provide customized advice on how to improve your looks.\r\n\r\nHOW IT WORKS\r\n\r\n1) Upload or take photos of yourself in various angles.\r\n\r\n2) RateByFresh will use the latest technology in AI to analyze your images.\r\n\r\n3) Get image analyze results\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\nWe currently have 8 glow up scans.\r\n\r\n1) Face Rater\r\n\r\n2) Skincare Scanner\r\n\r\n3) Hairstyle Optimizer\r\n\r\n4) Body & Posture Scanner\r\n\r\n5) Fragrance Recommender\r\n\r\n6) Dimorphism Feature\r\n\r\n7) Outfit Rater\r\n\r\n8) Color Analysis\r\n\r\nDISCLAIMER\r\n\r\nThe advice and recommendations provided by the RateByFresh app, including assessments of facial aesthetics, haircare suggestions, and skincare routines, are based on artificial intelligence analysis and general best practices in beauty and grooming. These recommendations are intended for informational purposes only and should not be considered as professional or medical advice.\r\n\r\nResults may vary for each user due to individual differences in facial features, hair types, skin conditions, and personal preferences. We encourage users to use their discretion when following the app\u2019s advice and to consult with professional stylists, dermatologists, or other qualified healthcare providers for personalized guidance, especially in cases of specific concerns or conditions.\r\n\r\nThe RateByFresh app does not guarantee specific outcomes from the use of its recommendations and disclaims any liability for unsatisfactory results or any injury resulting from the application of such advice.\r\n\r\nBy using the RateByFresh app, you agree to the terms outlined in our Terms of Use and acknowledge having read our Privacy Policy.\r\n\r\n\r\nTerms: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\r\n\r\nPrivacy: https://ratebyfresh.com/privacy-policy/",
